<view class="admin-page admin-secondary-page admin-review-appeal-list-page">
  <view class="admin-header">
    <view class="admin-title">{{ title }}</view>
    <view class="admin-subtitle">
      处理师傅提交的差评申诉；当前为平台人工审核，不做自动风控裁决。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-status-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">状态信息</view>
    <view class="admin-section-note">
      申诉审核结果通过 review service 提交，评价治理和状态记录以后端为准。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-filter-card">
    <view class="admin-filter-title">筛选区</view>
    <view class="admin-filter-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{ filterPills }}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="admin-filter-pill {{ index === 0 ? 'admin-filter-pill--active' : '' }}"
      >
        {{ item }}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <loading-view wx:if="{{ loading }}" text="正在加载申诉"></loading-view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ errorText }}" class="admin-section-card admin-error-card">
    {{ errorText }}
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{ groupedAppeals.length }}">
    <view
      wx:for="{{ groupedAppeals }}"
      wx:key="workerId"
      wx:for-item="group"
      class="admin-section-card admin-group-card"
    >
      <view class="admin-section-title">用户或服务方信息</view>
      <view class="admin-section-note">师傅：{{ group.workerName }}</view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{ group.appeals }}"
        wx:key="_id"
        wx:for-item="item"
        class="admin-list-card appeal-card"
        data-id="{{ item._id }}"
        bindtap="goDetail"
      >
        <view class="admin-list-card-head">
          <view>
            <view class="admin-card-title">{{ item.reason || '申诉理由未填写' }}</view>
            <view class="admin-card-subtitle">订单：{{ item.order_no || item.order_id || '未记录' }}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="admin-status-pill admin-status-pill--warning">
            {{ item.status || '待处理' }}
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-detail-row">
          <text class="admin-detail-label">基础信息</text>
          <text class="admin-detail-value">差评申诉</text>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-detail-row">
          <text class="admin-detail-label">操作记录</text>
          <text class="admin-detail-value">点击查看审核详情</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <empty-state
    wx:else
    title="暂无申诉"
    description="师傅提交差评申诉后会展示在这里"
  ></empty-state>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-action-card admin-boundary-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">管理操作</view>
    <view class="admin-section-note">
      申诉需进入详情页人工处理，本页不直接改写评价状态或处罚服务方。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
